# Navigation 3 Pattern

## Routes (`FleetRoute.kt`)
```kotlin
@Serializable
sealed interface FleetRoute : NavKey {
    @Serializable data object Dashboard : FleetRoute
    @Serializable data object Vehicles : FleetRoute
    @Serializable data class VehicleDetail(val vehicleId: String) : FleetRoute
}
```
- `data object` for leaf routes (no params)
- `data class` for parameterized routes
- All routes `@Serializable` and implement `FleetRoute : NavKey`

## NavEntry (`FleetNavigation.kt`)
```kotlin
is FleetRoute.Vehicles -> NavEntry(route) {
    val vm = rememberViewModel { viewModelProvider.vehiclesViewModel() }
    VehicleFeatureFacade.VehiclesListEntry(
        viewModel = vm,
        onNavigateBack = { backStack.removeLastOrNull() },
        onNavigateToDetail = { id -> backStack.add(FleetRoute.VehicleDetail(id)) },
        onNavigateToAdd = { backStack.add(FleetRoute.AddVehicle) }
    )
}
```

## Rules
- ViewModel created via `rememberViewModel { viewModelProvider.xxxViewModel() }`
- Navigation via `backStack.add(route)` / `backStack.removeLastOrNull()`
- Screen accessed through `FeatureFacade` entry point, not direct composable
- Deep navigation: `backStack.add()` multiple routes for nested screens
